[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16326.63, "timestamp": "04:32:06", "text": "模型。是的，就像他一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16328.95, "timestamp": "04:32:08", "text": "也像是另一种风格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16332.63, "timestamp": "04:32:12", "text": "就好像我只是看了一眼，然后我就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16333.95, "timestamp": "04:32:13", "text": "当时的感觉就像是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16336.79, "timestamp": "04:32:16", "text": "“哇，我也想要那个。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16340.95, "timestamp": "04:32:20", "text": "所以我一直在学习如何喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16343.03, "timestamp": "04:32:23", "text": "因为你必须制作那个黏土模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16345.59, "timestamp": "04:32:25", "text": "首先要了解自己，然后你才会喜欢自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16352.55, "timestamp": "04:32:32", "text": "把它装到你知道的那些东西上。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16355.429, "timestamp": "04:32:35", "text": "是的，我一直在尝试做这些，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16357.189, "timestamp": "04:32:37", "text": "过去几周我只是想做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16359.51, "timestamp": "04:32:39", "text": "就像黏土模型一样，它不会变形。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16363.189, "timestamp": "04:32:43", "text": "因为没有相关的教程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16365.269, "timestamp": "04:32:45", "text": "啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16367.91, "timestamp": "04:32:47", "text": "但没错，这感觉就像是你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16369.11, "timestamp": "04:32:49", "text": "知道什么？我这就给你演示一下。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16371.99, "timestamp": "04:32:51", "text": "如果我向你展示我是什么，你就能明白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16375.75, "timestamp": "04:32:55", "text": "谈论。好的。"}]